        "filing_date": "2026-02-27",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "To that end, we provide extensive training and development sessions, strong benefits, and competitive pay to employees at all levels in the organization, including equity awards to key contributors.",
        "start_character": 41248,
        "end_character": 41446
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000891166-26-000010",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000891166-26-000010-cb59d3c770eea5e4",
        "accession_number": "0000891166-26-000010",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-27",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "however, insurance regulatory authorities in any state in which we operate may conduct examinations at their discretion.",
        "start_character": 28885,
        "end_character": 29005
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000891166-26-000010",
